# PUBLIC — the publish allowlist (T-231). Deny-by-default.
#
# `node scripts/publish.mjs` exports a tracked file to the public repo only if a line below
# matches it. Anything not listed stays private. One entry per line:
#   dir/        everything under that directory
#   a/b.json    exactly that file
#   docs/*.md   `*` stays within one path segment, `**` crosses segments
# No negation. The hard deny list in scripts/publish.mjs (workspace dirs, .env*, keys) beats
# this file, so listing a path here can never publish it.

